g\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"boxed_image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Rusty_Puncher.png/revision/latest?cb=20250210223517\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Rusty Puncher\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Rusty_Puncher.png/revision/latest?cb=20250210223517\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Rusty_Puncher.png/revision/latest?cb=20250210223517 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bc/Rusty_Puncher.png/revision/latest?cb=20250210223517 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Rusty Puncher\" width=\"211\" height=\"451\" data-image-key=\"Rusty_Puncher.png\" data-image-name=\"Rusty Puncher.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Acidlands</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Skeleton Merchant</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$5,600</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Weapon</div>\n</div>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Punchy Puncher resembles a <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a> but with the top part removed and replaced with a boxing glove. it is the Starter weapon available for purchase for $5,600. It deals close to 1 damage but does considerable knockback roughly triple of what the <a href=\"/wiki/Rust_Breaker\" title=\"Rust Breaker\">Rust Breaker</a> does, it has low cooldown.\n</p><p>Like all other starter weapons, it is available without completing <a href=\"/wiki/The_Arena\" title=\"The Arena\">The Arena.</a>\n</p><p>While it is useless at killing enemies and at completing <a href=\"/wiki/The_Arena\" title=\"The Arena\">the Arena</a>, the Puncher can be helpful at launching enemies off of cliffs or into other hazards.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Grabbygrabberonwronghand.png/revision/latest?cb=20250819205419\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"The Grabby Grabber, with the glove clearly on the wrong hand\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/6/6d/Grabbygrabberonwronghand.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250819205419\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Grabbygrabberonwronghand.png\" data-image-key=\"Grabbygrabberonwronghand.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Grabbygrabberonwronghand.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">The Grabby Grabber, with the glove clearly on the wrong hand</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The description \"for some reason the glove is the wrong way\" is correct as this is a left-hand glove but when you equip it, it is on the right hand. this could be some inside joke or it's because the grabbers are modeled and animated on the right hand and the glove was designed left-handed.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163515\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.084 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 71/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019494/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   32.038      1 Template:Tool\n100.00%   32.038      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4326-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 202